### 1. Create a New Course (Expect 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java Concurrency",
  "description": "Threads, Virtual Threads, and Executors",
  "target_date": "2026-12-31",
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### 2. Fetch All Courses (Expect 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses

### 3. Fetch Single Course by ID (Expect 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1

### 4. Update Course (Expect 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Java Concurrency Masterclass",
  "description": "Deep dive into reactive and concurrent Java",
  "target_date": "2026-11-30",
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 5. Get Statistics (Expect 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/stats

### 6. Search Courses by Query (Expect 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/search?q=concurrency

### 7. Delete Course (Expect 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1

### 8. Verify Course Deleted (Expect 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1